                                                "text": "a Manhattan loft"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebc740e5-769c-41b7-88f4-4632b2c58c2b",
                                                "sense_id": "af9c79e1-47ea-33d7-874a-61b5bc2a7879",
                                                "text": "Today, with a loft in Manhattan and a condo in Century City, they are the epitome of the bi-coastal couple."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c07e5ce1-0be1-3769-a33c-2ab73c9034c0",
