                                                "sense_id": "c07e5ce1-0be1-3769-a33c-2ab73c9034c0",
                                                "text": "Releasing some of the 12,000 racing pigeons that had arrived by special train (in foreground) at Dumfries Station for a race to their home lofts in Lanarkshire and West Lothian"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
